; The D directive names the default commodity.  It is the default
; target of -V, but it does not give its style to amounts written
; without a commodity: those keep the null commodity's style.  The
; later EUR price in CHF makes -V pick D's commodity over the most
; recent price, so the second block fails if D stops being the target.
D $1,000.00

P 2024/01/01 EUR $2.00
P 2024/01/05 EUR 1.5 CHF

2024/01/02 Bare
    A                1234.5
    B

2024/01/03 Euros
    C               10 EUR
    D

test reg A
24-Jan-02 Bare                  A                            1234.5       1234.5
end test

test bal -V C --now 2024/02/01
              $20.00  C
end test
